engine.diagnostics_engine.bsod_without_d:
Windows restarted after a blue screen, but no .dmp file or report could be written. Common causes: page file too small or disabled, dump recording turned off, or a failing system drive. Check "Blue screen recording" in Hardware so the next one can be analysed.

